<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>EAW:Remake - third-party licences</title>
<style>
body { font: 15px/1.5 system-ui, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 24px; color: #1b1f24; background: #fff; }
main { max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; }
h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; }
h2 { font-size: 1.25rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
ul.used-by { columns: 3 220px; padding-left: 1.2rem; margin-top: 0.25rem; }
pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f4f6f8; border: 1px solid #d8dde3; padding: 12px; font-size: 13px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<h1>Third-party licences</h1>
<p>EAW:Remake is MIT-licensed. The program is built from the open-source projects listed below; their licence texts and
copyright notices follow. The program contains no game data: it reads Star Wars: Empire at War and the Empire at War
Remake mod from the player's own Steam installation.</p>

<h2>Embedded assets</h2>
<h3 id="fira-mono">Fira Mono (subset, the default font of Bevy's text module)</h3>
<p>Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.</p>
<pre>
@@FIRA_MONO_OFL@@
</pre>

<h2>Licences of the Rust crates</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
<li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>

{{#each licenses}}
<h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul class="used-by">
{{#each used_by}}
<li><a href="https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}/{{crate.version}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</main>
</body>
</html>
